{
  "title": "Report Builder: Drag-and-Drop Reports Over Your Site's Data | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "The CrestApps Report Builder lets the people who run your Orchard Core site build their own reports by dragging fields, instead of asking a developer for a query. Pick data sets, join them, group and total them, add charts and pivot tables, and share the result.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why fixed reports fall short, and how the Report Builder is organized\n• Building a report: data sets, columns, aggregates and formulas\n• Filters, visuals, and the kinds of reports\n• Joining data sets, and choosing which rows a join keeps\n• Every data source a report can read\n• Publishing, drafts and versions\n• A reusable view, and a report built on it\n• Sharing with people, roles and share links, and exporting\n• Adding your own data source as a developer",
